{%- comment -%}
  Returns a concise, product-safe image alt value.
  Supplier imports can carry marketplace listing titles hundreds of characters long.
  Preserve intentional concise alt text; otherwise fall back to the curated product title.
  Usage: {% capture image_alt %}{% render 'product-image-alt', image: image, product: product %}{% endcapture %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign safe_alt = image.alt | strip
  if safe_alt == blank or safe_alt.size > 140
    assign safe_alt = product.title | strip
  endif
-%}{{- safe_alt -}}